WEBVTT

00:01:59.948 --> 00:02:01.158
and every year,

00:02:01.182 --> 00:02:04.523
members of our town
would turn out and protest them.

00:02:04.547 --> 00:02:08.395
Now, in 2001, I graduated
from high school,

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:12.577
and I went to college in New York City.

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:16.553
I arrived in August 2001.

00:02:17.482 --> 00:02:19.766
As many of you probably are aware,

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:21.681
three weeks later,

00:02:21.705 --> 00:02:23.500
the Twin Towers went down.

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:27.997
Now, I was shocked.

00:02:28.503 --> 00:02:30.878
I was incredibly angry.